<title>JAPAN: Japan August aluminium alloy shipments edge lower.</title>
<headline>Japan August aluminium alloy shipments edge lower.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's aluminium alloy shipments and output edged marginally lower in August from the same month last year, the Japan Aluminium Alloy Refiners' Association said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>August shipments fell 0.1 percent year-on-year to 71,007 tonnes. Production was down 0.7 percent at 70,780 tonnes.</p>
<p>Inventories at the month's end stood at 24,297 tonnes, off 6.8 percent year-on-year but up 1.6 percent from the previous month's 23,922 tonnes.</p>
<p>Shipments for die-cast products fell 8.7 percent to 32,463 tonnes, while those for forged products rose 10.3 percent to 19,171 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk (81-3 3432-6179)</p>
